Z||000000||FieroLisa||02-22-2001||02:07 PM||||Alright I have a final paper due in my Western Civ class in a few weeks. I'm trying to get started on it, the general topic is "what is the value of history" Anyone into this sort of stuff that wants to chat and help me get started? I just need someone to bounce ideas off of. <BR>Thanks! I have a 90% in the class- an A-, so I really need to do well to keep it an A!<P>Lisa||||reg||1
