Z||000009||bHooper||02-22-2001||06:12 PM||||Lisa,<P>It is true that history is mostly written by the winners, however it is on occaison written by the "loser's".  There have been times when things have benn rewritten to make the losers look "rosy".<P>As for the "value" of history, without it we would not have a "present" or a future.  Because unless you know where you've been, you don't know where you're going!<P>only 2 more broken sentances with no discernable point, and I'll shut up.<P>Youi may also want to look into some of the civilizations that didn't have a written, or verbal history.  Examples of this would be, the civ. that lived at matzupech (i spelled it wrong, its that pallace way up in the andes), as well as the pacific tribe that made themselves extinct in the mid century.  the name excapes me, but this tribe cut the tongue out of the "tribal historian" so that he couldnt speak the history, and then began sterilizing all the children in the village.  so that over a period of 60 years or so the tribe went from a 100 people to 0!  this was a tribe that had once wrecked havoc on the south pacific, ruling many islands.  being considered a great power!<P>Lastly, history's other great "value" is entertainment.   How many times have you listend to some old fart talk about the depression, or how wonderfull he thought spam was, the first time he ate it!<P>Good luck!<P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000010||FieroLisa||02-22-2001||06:20 PM||||Thanks! Does anyone else have more info on the civilization and tribe that hoop was talking about, names or something so I can look up more info on those. I have 3 points I want to make in this paper: 1) History helps make you an unbiased and philosophical thinker 2)History can be used to learn about human life now 3) History makes each generation better off than the last and human progress depends on it. This is just me brainstorming and trying to get ideas so sorry if some sound dumb! :-) I also have to include how the book "After Long Silence" by Helen Fremont applies. <BR>Have I mentioned I can't wait till summer :-)<BR>||||reg||1
